      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gypsum%2C_Colorado"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Gypsum sits in the Eagle River valley, where the river flows westward into the Colorado River system.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
